            "review_title": "Review at Green Inn - Plant-based Restaurant",
            "review_text": "VoltronAndRamona\nRingwood12 contributions\n0\nVegan Oasis\nDec 2024 • Family\nMany restaurants advertise vegetarian food and it’s just five dishes in the menu. The Green Inn is 100% vegan. The dishes are inspired by traditional flavors but it’s the ingredients that make them unique and delicious. The dishes feature many kinds of mushrooms which in the USA are at a premium. But the prices here are great. I had the pumpkin soup, Pho and mango sorbet. All delicious. I will be back in the area in a few days and plan to go back to try the rest of the extensive menu.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nHigh quality and healthy ingredients\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 21, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
